| 1 | 0 | 3.6055512754639896 | -0 | 1.6641005886756874 | 6.000000000000001 | false |
| 2 | 0 | 2 | 0 | 3 | 6 | false |
\image(figures/rectangle_tiny.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Actual projected extents for a small triangle.)
